OL,3,APrimark finally set to launch home
OL,4,Adeliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimark has said it plans to launch a
OL,7,Fhome delivery service in Britain, four
OL,8,Fyears after it made its first foray
OL,9,Finto e-commerce.
OL,11,FThe retailer did not say when it
OL,12,Fexpects to launch the service, but it
OL,13,Fhas bought a warehouse in Sheffield to
OL,14,Fenable it to ship products to homes.
OL,16,FThe company said there was "opportunity
OL,17,Ffor profitable growth" through home
OL,18,Fdeliveries, which could help boost
OL,19,Ftrade after Primark reported subdued
OL,20,Fsales following the recent hot weather.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
