OL,3,APrimark finally set to launch home
OL,4,Adeliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnalysts said the decision to offer
OL,7,Fhome delivery after years of resistance
OL,8,F- including through the pandemic -
OL,9,Findicated that Primark was facing major
OL,10,Fchallenges from ultra-fast-fashion
OL,11,Fbrands such as Shein.
